  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Trump Call**: The Caller names the suit (Rung) based on their first 5 cards. 2. **The Lead**: Caller leads the first trick. 3. **The Trick**: Players must follow suit. Highest trump wins; if no trump, highest card of led suit wins. 4. **Accumulation Rule**: When a player wins a trick, they DO NOT collect the cards yet. The cards remain face down in the center heap. 5. **Double Sar Rule**: If the SAME player wins the *next* trick (two in a row), they capture the ENTIRE heap (all previous uncollected tricks) and place them in their team's pile. 6. **13th Trick**: The winner of the 13th (final) trick captures strictly that trick plus any uncollected heap remaining.",
    Player: "1. **Trump Call**: The Caller names the suit (Rung) based on their first 5 cards. 2. **The Lead**: Caller leads the first trick. 3. **The Trick**: Players must follow suit. Highest trump wins; if no trump, highest card of led suit wins. 4. **Accumulation Rule**: When a player wins a trick, they DO NOT collect the cards yet. The cards remain face down in the center heap. 5. **Double Sar Rule**: If the SAME player wins the *next* trick (two in a row), they capture the ENTIRE heap (all previous uncollected tricks) and place them in their team's pile. 6. **13th Trick**: The winner of the 13th (final) trick captures strictly that trick plus any uncollected heap remaining.",
    objective: "Win the majority of the 13 tricks (7 or more) by capturing the accumulated heaps. Or inflict a 'Kot' (Slam) by winning all tricks.",
    gameplay: "1. **Trump Call**: The Caller names the suit (Rung) based on their first 5 cards. 2. **The Lead**: Caller leads the first trick. 3. **The Trick**: Players must follow suit. Highest trump wins; if no trump, highest card of led suit wins. 4. **Accumulation Rule**: When a player wins a trick, they DO NOT collect the cards yet. The cards remain face down in the center heap. 5. **Double Sar Rule**: If the SAME player wins the *next* trick (two in a row), they capture the ENTIRE heap (all previous uncollected tricks) and place them in their team's pile. 6. **13th Trick**: The winner of the 13th (final) trick captures strictly that trick plus any uncollected heap remaining.",
    keyRules: [
      "You must win TWO consecutive tricks to 'consume' the heap.",
      'If Partner A wins Trick 1, and Partner B wins Trick 2, the heap is NOT captured. The *same individual* must win twice (or Partner B must win Trick 3 to capture Trick 2 + 3, but Trick 1 might be lost).',
      'Ideally, you want to let the opponents win single tricks to build the heap, then intercept with two powerful cards to steal it all.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: true,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
    setup: {
      players: '4 players in fixed partnerships.',
      deck: 'Standard 52-card deck. A-K-Q-J-10...2.',
