      draw: 'Each player receives thirteen cards at the start and no further drawing occurs during the play of the hand.',
      discard: "Every card in the player's hand must be played into a trick; no cards are discarded to a waste pile.",
      pass: 'Players must always play a card to every trick if possible; passing a turn without action is not permitted.',
      bid: 'The trump suit is called directly by the designated player rather than determined through a bidding auction.',
      meld: 'This is strictly a trick-taking game based on card values rather than the formation of sets or melds.',
